@startuml
title 02  |  Bounded review analysis

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #37678C
  LifeLineBorderColor #A9BAC8
  ParticipantBorderColor #476782
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF3FA
  GroupBorderColor #91AAC0
  GroupBackgroundColor #F5F9FC
  NoteBorderColor #D7B766
  NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8E7
}

boundary "Streamlit UI" as UI
control "Review service" as Review
database "SQLite repository" as Store
control "Model adapter" as Adapter
participant "Local Ollama" as Ollama

UI -> Review: Analyze product variant
Review -> Store: Load permitted, variant-mapped reviews
Store --> Review: Review IDs, source refs, allowed text
Review -> Review: Deduplicate and sample within limits
Review -> Store: Lookup validated extraction cache\n(evidence + model/prompt/schema versions)
Store --> Review: Valid hit or miss

alt Valid cache hit
  Review -> Review: Reuse public extraction
else Cache miss
  loop Bounded batches and remaining call budget
    Review -> Adapter: Extract structured findings from sample
    Adapter -> Ollama: Bounded local model call
    Ollama --> Adapter: Output and token status
    Adapter -> Store: Append redacted actual-call usage event
    Store --> Adapter: Event status
    Adapter --> Review: Schema-checked result or failure
  end
  Review -> Review: Validate supporting review IDs
  opt Validated public extraction exists
    Review -> Store: Cache findings by evidence and versions
    Store --> Review: Cache write status
  end
end

Review -> Review: Aggregate validated findings in Python
Review --> UI: Findings, coverage, or explicit unavailability

note over Review, Store
  A cache hit creates no model-call event.
  User-specific matching remains in session.
end note
@enduml
